    "title": "Jennifer Van Vrancken 'strongly considering' running for Jefferson Parish president - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Sabrina Wilson ,\n4 hours ago NEW ORLEANS (WVUE) - Jefferson Parish at-large councilwoman Jennifer Van Vrancken says she is interested in running for the job of parish president. “Strongly considering running, because in public service you always have to be thinking about, ‘What are the best ways that I can serve the people?’ And so, it’s definitely something you have to look at and people have encouraged me to look at,” Van Vrancken said. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
